  <h1>Create your account</h1>

  <!--
    No "action" attribute: the page then only shows a confirmation message.
    Add action="/your-endpoint" and the form is posted normally once every field is valid.

    The email field is deliberately type="text", not type="email": browsers disagree on
    internationalized addresses (some reject "marie.dupont@société.fr", one silently rewrites
    the domain to Punycode, and all reject a Unicode local part such as "josé@example.fr").
    The script below does its own check and accepts them.
